{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you must strategically position your allies on the rooftops of the favela to stop enemies from invading and protect your territory. Hold out as long as possible to earn even greater rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you earn to place allies in tactical spots and purchase upgrades. Buy ability cards to make it harder for enemies to advance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Achieve higher scores and rise above other players on the local and global leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new challenges</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out different maps and test your skills with increasingly difficult levels.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Caos vermelho","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679920/60c78b8405f50aae86f51dc8dd0c6c7cf2a451eb.jpg"},{"name":"Caos azul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679920/fec2be16c221886f5c8b13b86d1c086ce2a27dad.jpg"},{"name":"Caos azul claro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679920/8798bd266e5a8566802ed0c189276459a50eb78f.jpg"},{"name":"Caos branco","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679920/d96299525af804f7a247357488ff61fafbfce44b.jpg"},{"name":"Caos cinza","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679920/4bbd40e567a845e87986262d5692f85371cbbc67.jpg"},{"name":"Caos vermelho escuro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679920/16cd334f141a0ba1a4b51b77b77c5589cc9b96e4.jpg"},{"name":"Chuva de sucata","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679920/f8f34da3c96e7406